WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.919 --> 00:00:19.577
The PIN is changed in Settings, not in the panel.

2
00:00:19.577 --> 00:00:26.943
Tap the gear, at the top right of the kiosk.

3
00:00:26.943 --> 00:00:33.395
Settings opens with Face ID or the iPad passcode, never the PIN.

4
00:00:33.395 --> 00:00:39.016
Tap Change PIN.

5
00:00:39.016 --> 00:00:45.364
Type the PIN you use now.

6
00:00:45.364 --> 00:00:51.196
Then the new one.

7
00:00:51.196 --> 00:00:57.372
And again, to be sure.

8
00:00:57.372 --> 00:01:07.233
Tap Change PIN. The new one works straight away.
